      "reason": "The manuscript specifies setting (regional states of Ethiopia) and eligible study designs (observational, including case-control and cross-sectional) and outcomes (prevalence/incidence of SSI and associated factors). It does not specify follow-up requirements or other question-framework components in the provided evidence, so not all study characteristics required for full eligibility specification are reported."
